<title>USA: Foster Wheeler unit gets $174.4 mln contract.</title>
<headline>Foster Wheeler unit gets $174.4 mln contract.</headline>
<dateline>CLINTON, N.J. 1996-11-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Foster Wheeler Energy International Inc said Friday that a subsidiary has received a $174.4 million contract to supply two 660 megawatt anthracite-fired boilers and auxiliaries for a Chinese power plant.</p>
<p>The contract is between its unit, Foster Wheeler Energy Corp, and Hebei Electric Power Corp, which is part of a joint venture operating the plant.</p>
<p>The plant will be located in Yijing, a town near Handan City in Hebei Province.</p>
